        "page": 1,
        "section": "rule",
        "sentence_id": "p1_r2"
      },
      "text": "Unit 42 has been tracking an APT campaign we name TiltedTemple, which we first identified in connection with its use of the Zoho ManageEngine ADSelfService Plus vulnerability CVE-2021-40539 and ServiceDesk Plus vulnerability CVE-2021-44077. The threat actors involved use a variety of techniques to gain access to and persistence in compromised systems and have successfully compromised more than a dozen organizations across the technology, energy, healthcare, education, finance and defense industries. In conducting further analysis of this campaign, we identified another sophisticated tool being used to maintain persistence, which we call SockDetour.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "note": "rule or indicator snippet evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_32",
